mary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并确认统计分析计划中样本量计算假设，核实120例是否满足探索性精度要求","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_ss_params","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"5.1节样本量计算五要素（率差/SD/α/把握度）"}],"heading":"计划入组人数","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究计划入组120例受试者，按1:1:1比例随机分配至MY009212A片160mg每日两次组、MY009212A片80mg每日两次组和安慰剂组，每组40例。本样本量基于探索性精度考量确定，旨在为IIa期概念验证与剂量探索提供初步疗效信号估计及安全性描述性数据，不作为正式确证性功效计算。具体样本量假设参数（包括预期缓解率差值、标准差、显著性水平及把握度）详见统计分析计划。","rationale":"样本量120例（每组40例）及1:1:1随机比例来源于项目已确认研究事实中的样本量策略条目；'探索性精度考量'为原声明限定语，已保留。五要素计算参数未在项目事实中展开，指向SAP，故标记partial。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_7ea3c3a950d31870","section_number":"5.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012154323_fd3fb6fd","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取本项目筛选操作手册或中心SOP中关于筛选失败判定、允许重复检查的条件与次数、重新筛选触发条件及新编号分配规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_screening_ops","missing_source_classes":["项目筛选操作手册","中心标准操作规程"],"target":"5.5节筛选失败定义、重复检查条件、重新筛选条件及编号规则"}],"heading":"筛选失败与重新筛选","missing_source_classes":["项目筛选操作手册","中心标准操作规程","筛选失败与重新筛选处理规程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要项目级筛选操作文件（如筛选操作手册、中心SOP或筛选失败处理规程）方可撰写实质正文。公司语料中虽含通用筛选失败定义与重新筛选流程描述，但属于跨项目结构参照，不可作为本项目已确认操作规则直接写入。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_d267cd99c647e782","section_number":"5.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012154323_fd3fb6fd","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组；3:3:3随机至160mg BID/80mg BID/安慰剂，双盲治疗期12周；不采用受试者内剂量递增。","quote_sha256":"f5aa84b5556c73768b9bd9d1748dd3c3c59cafa00a217bf37a008213cf41f35c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_treatment_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"MY009212A片：每日两次（BID）、每次一片、约间隔12小时，空腹或餐后均可；药物由申办方统一提供；依从性=实际/计划服药量×100%（80%-120%）。","quote_sha256":"ba5aacd5f6036bfef22759e2815fa1434fddeb1cadafc1148796371579d6159c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_dose_regimen"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"依从性=实际/计划服药量×100%（80%-120%）。","quote_sha256":"2ba680a6063cf3785242955b2c8372e314cf9c995d6b57ca6086f25e8044cdcb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂对照（双盲双模拟）；主要疗效终点按160mg BID vs 安慰剂、80mg BID vs 安慰剂比较；安全性在各平行组间比较；不设阳性对照。","quote_sha256":"fa872ebd3a8a4f353006df2919ab247c2c1af7c0f1e40975177007f963f1b3d1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"筛选期：D-28至D-1（4周）；双盲治疗期：D1至D84（12周）；安全性随访期：D85至D98（2周）","quote_sha256":"5bca1c9f15bb68c6f868519610036e6de9a1db6868fd020039d38bc9d1d0223a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_study_period"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_treatment_design","es_dose_regimen","es_adherence","es_placebo","es_study_period"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取项目剂量调整操作规程或医学监查决策树","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_dose_mod","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整与停药操作规程"],"target":"6节剂量调整、暂停、恢复及永久停药规则"},{"action":"获取药物过量与给药错误处理规程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_overdose","missing_source_classes":["药物过量与给药错误处理规程"],"target":"6节药物过量与给药错误处理"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整与停药操作规程","药物过量与给药错误处理规程"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计，共设三个治疗组：MY009212A片160mg每日两次组（候选推荐II期剂量）、MY009212A片80mg每日两次组（低剂量探索组）和安慰剂组。三组按1:1:1比例随机分配，不采用受试者内剂量递增。双盲治疗期为12周（D1至D84），治疗期后设2周安全性随访期（D85至D98）。MY009212A片与安慰剂均采用每日两次口服给药，每次一片，给药间隔约12小时，空腹或餐后均可服用。安慰剂为与活性药外观匹配的模拟制剂，采用双盲双模拟方式实施。主要疗效终点按160mg每日两次组与安慰剂、80mg每日两次组与安慰剂分别比较；安全性在各平行组间进行比较；本研究不设阳性对照。受试者依从性以实际服药量与计划服药量之比（百分比）评价，80%至120%视为依从性可接受。","rationale":"三臂设计、1:1:1随机、双盲双模拟、12周治疗期、BID给药、依从性80%-120%窗口、不设阳性对照及主要终点比较方式均来源于项目已确认研究事实。剂量调整/暂停/恢复/永久停药规则、药物过量处理及给药错误处理在本批次允许来源中未提供，标记partial。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_94a050b1075dec71","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012154323_fd3fb6fd","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"MY009212A片（VNN1抑制剂，40mg/片薄膜衣片）口服；两个活性剂量组：160mg BID（候选RP2D）与80mg BID（低剂量探索组），连续12周；安慰剂组口服模拟制剂BID。","quote_sha256":"f7c789d94ba9a0ae3c85a629da6de51e6ede36d1a93e54314e279f5111c91386","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_drug_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂对照（双盲双模拟）；主要疗效终点按160mg BID vs 安慰剂、80mg BID vs 安慰剂比较；安全性在各平行组间比较；不设阳性对照。","quote_sha256":"fa872ebd3a8a4f353006df2919ab247c2c1af7c0f1e40975177007f963f1b3d1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"MY009212A片：每日两次（BID）、每次一片、约间隔12小时，空腹或餐后均可；药物由申办方统一提供；依从性=实际/计划服药量×100%（80%-120%）。","quote_sha256":"ba5aacd5f6036bfef22759e2815fa1434fddeb1cadafc1148796371579d6159c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_dose_regimen"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_0d2c837ebee7effc:full-draft:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","quote":"MY009212A片","quote_sha256":"0a15855bf6a5b24e40d2721b3717c7fb1909d281d4cb4ca816d3919bba323827","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","span_id":"es_drug_name"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_drug_identity","es_placebo","es_dose_regimen","es_drug_name"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取项目药品管理手册或药学部门提供的包装储存规范","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_packaging","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品包装与储存规范","药品发放与回收操作规程"],"target":"6.1节试验用药品包装形式、储存条件、运输要求及发放回收流程"}],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品包装与储存规范","药品发放与回收操作规程"],"proposal_text":"本研究试验用药品为MY009212A片，系VNN1（烟酰胺酶）抑制剂，属小分子化合物，以游离碱计每片含40mg活性成分，剂型为薄膜衣片，给药途径为口服。活性药组受试者每次口服4片（160mg组）或2片（80mg组），每日两次，给药间隔约12小时。安慰剂为与MY009212A片外观、规格及包装形式匹配的模拟制剂，同样以每日两次口服方式给予，采用双盲双模拟设计。试验用药品由申办方统一提供。","rationale":"MY009212A片为VNN1抑制剂、40mg/片薄膜衣片、口服给药、双盲双模拟及申办方统一提供均来源于项目已确认研究事实。片数由剂量与规格推导（160mg÷40mg=4片，80mg÷40mg=2片）。包装规格、储存条件、运输要求、发放与回收流程在本批次允许来源中未提供，标记partial。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_e5ef1a7532846dd3","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"9fa9ae9240e07aecdf563bd4801ea64ab8fc363dea6c520fd7941b08b71218dd","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_0d2c837ebee7effc:full-draft:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d8b4e74314ea8600f6e332c9315e43e742fa7765d4659f4dac067ea7f8d977b1:7b61f73f25e243b4fc47a6ff","text_sha256":"9fa9ae9240e07aecdf563bd4801ea64ab8fc363dea6c520fd7941b08b71218dd"},{"content_sha256":"b1cdf82eef4117c1236a8289de21d3f040921de464d4a165b639b13b0018592d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","text_sha256":"b1cdf82eef4117c1236a8289de21d3f040921de464d4a165b639b13b0018592d"},{"content_sha256":"abe327b691816a29b09e2ea049d5e7c9be77469b1d15bea0df6450cb8ea32782","locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:460|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"0eebb4939327b8","text_sha256":"abe327b691816a29b09e2ea049d5e7c9be77469b1d15bea0df6450cb8ea32782"}]}